(2938651, 411060, 19672, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the composition. It''s a nice scene. But I think by cutting off the side of the boardwalk it''s become too distracting and my eyes have trouble finding anywhere to focus.<br/> <br/>They try to focus the boardwalk and are cut off. If it was included, I think my eyes would follow the boardwalk all the way up the hill and into the setting sun and it would have been a great capture.<br/> <br/>(3) but a potentially a 5+</td>', 'I don''t like the composition. It''s a nice scene. But I think by cutting off the side of the boardwalk it''s become too distracting and my eyes have trouble finding anywhere to focus. They try to focus the boardwalk and are cut off. If it was included, I think my eyes would follow the boardwalk all the way up the hill and into the setting sun and it would have been a great capture. (3) but a potentially a 5+', '2006-10-18 01:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
