(2939841, 413021, 67258, '<td valign="top">A darker sky may have helped bring out the lights more - as itis the shot doesn''t have quite the impact that perhaps it should.</td>', 'A darker sky may have helped bring out the lights more - as itis the shot doesn''t have quite the impact that perhaps it should.', '2006-10-18 09:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
