(2939904, 412943, 60495, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting, the focus on the front stock is a little distracting but the overall color and texture carries the image.</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting, the focus on the front stock is a little distracting but the overall color and texture carries the image.', '2006-10-18 10:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939919, 410822, 60495, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light encourages you to go down the path amd the glow of the trees in the back ground.  Nice image</td>', 'I like the way the light encourages you to go down the path amd the glow of the trees in the back ground.  Nice image', '2006-10-18 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939925, 412785, 60495, '<td valign="top">nice, can not wait to see how this one was created...</td>', 'nice, can not wait to see how this one was created...', '2006-10-18 10:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939937, 412041, 18868, '<td valign="top">The green shape on the left side is distracting.  Pretty image otherwise.</td>', 'The green shape on the left side is distracting.  Pretty image otherwise.', '2006-10-18 10:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939940, 411862, 18868, '<td valign="top">This has a jjbeguin feel, which is intended as a compliment.  :)</td>', 'This has a jjbeguin feel, which is intended as a compliment.  :)', '2006-10-18 10:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939947, 412946, 18868, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  The bokeh is really interesting, very soft.</td>', 'Really nice.  The bokeh is really interesting, very soft.', '2006-10-18 10:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939952, 413092, 18868, '<td valign="top">At DPC, most people are pretty pedantic about focus.  You''ll also get some comments about using the full 640 pixel size.  I like the shapes, but it needs technical mastery to work as an image.</td>', 'At DPC, most people are pretty pedantic about focus.  You''ll also get some comments about using the full 640 pixel size.  I like the shapes, but it needs technical mastery to work as an image.', '2006-10-18 10:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939953, 413108, 5885, '<td valign="top">I think I found one of the ribbons :-)</td>', 'I think I found one of the ribbons :-)', '2006-10-18 10:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939957, 411575, 5885, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of light here.</td>', 'Very nice use of light here.', '2006-10-18 10:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939960, 411295, 18868, '<td valign="top">Spectacular!  Is that sand or salt?  There are no drips on the mushroom. :)</td>', 'Spectacular!  Is that sand or salt?  There are no drips on the mushroom. :)', '2006-10-18 10:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939968, 411997, 18868, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photo, but the title, while descriptive, is not particularly inspring.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photo, but the title, while descriptive, is not particularly inspring.', '2006-10-18 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939971, 412695, 5885, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and capture :-)</td>', 'Nice idea and capture :-)', '2006-10-18 10:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939974, 413003, 18868, '<td valign="top">Great location!  It seems a little soft, perhaps the original capture needed a tripod, or the web images needs a little more sharpening.</td>', 'Great location!  It seems a little soft, perhaps the original capture needed a tripod, or the web images needs a little more sharpening.', '2006-10-18 10:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939977, 412777, 18868, '<td valign="top">NICE!  I bet now we''re going to see a bunch of glowing soap images.  First 10 of the day.</td>', 'NICE!  I bet now we''re going to see a bunch of glowing soap images.  First 10 of the day.', '2006-10-18 10:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939978, 411863, 5885, '<td valign="top">This is just COOL :-)</td>', 'This is just COOL :-)', '2006-10-18 10:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939981, 411737, 18868, '<td valign="top">Very abstract, very pretty.  I like it.</td>', 'Very abstract, very pretty.  I like it.', '2006-10-18 10:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939993, 412728, 66967, '<td valign="top">Great use of light!</td>', 'Great use of light!', '2006-10-18 10:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939994, 412779, 52854, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo! Incredible light &amp; composition. Peace is the exact feel.</td>', 'A beautiful photo! Incredible light & composition. Peace is the exact feel.', '2006-10-18 10:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939996, 412372, 52854, '<td valign="top">Incredible light - beautifil scape!</td>', 'Incredible light - beautifil scape!', '2006-10-18 10:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2939997, 412285, 52854, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - wonderful light!</td>', 'Nice photo - wonderful light!', '2006-10-18 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940002, 410620, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Interesting photo &amp; light!</td>', 'Great shot! Interesting photo & light!', '2006-10-18 10:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940004, 412752, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-10-18 10:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940005, 410554, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great light &amp; color!</td>', 'Great light & color!', '2006-10-18 10:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940007, 412296, 18868, '<td valign="top">Great title!  I might have used slightly less exposure for more detail at the center of the cake.</td>', 'Great title!  I might have used slightly less exposure for more detail at the center of the cake.', '2006-10-18 10:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940022, 411169, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I find the very vertical edge of the magnifying lens somewhat distracting, and just a few degrees of rotation will help.  Also, not score-related, I (yes, me the city boy) think those are conchos, not spurs.  A spur rotates, and would need a hole in the center.</td>', 'Nice image.  I find the very vertical edge of the magnifying lens somewhat distracting, and just a few degrees of rotation will help.  Also, not score-related, I (yes, me the city boy) think those are conchos, not spurs.  A spur rotates, and would need a hole in the center.', '2006-10-18 10:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940029, 412808, 18868, '<td valign="top">Technically very nice, and I definitely like it, but I find the duotone a little over-done.  Perhaps taking some of the "ink" out of the highlights will provide a more balanced tonal sense.</td>', 'Technically very nice, and I definitely like it, but I find the duotone a little over-done.  Perhaps taking some of the "ink" out of the highlights will provide a more balanced tonal sense.', '2006-10-18 10:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940031, 413154, 18868, '<td valign="top">I like the horizontal presentation.  Very nice capture!</td>', 'I like the horizontal presentation.  Very nice capture!', '2006-10-18 10:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940037, 413316, 52854, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but very odd in its entirety. The light seems very secondary as I can''t get past the blurred figure and bright shape at the top left.</td>', 'Interesting idea but very odd in its entirety. The light seems very secondary as I can''t get past the blurred figure and bright shape at the top left.', '2006-10-18 11:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940046, 412904, 52854, '<td valign="top">Nice light!</td>', 'Nice light!', '2006-10-18 11:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940050, 413224, 52854, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo - Great light &amp; color.</td>', 'Really nice photo - Great light & color.', '2006-10-18 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940052, 411781, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-10-18 11:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940053, 412015, 18868, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT title!  Very graphic, dynamic composition.  Meets the challenge, but doesn''t rise to the challenge in the sense of using light*ing* as a creative element.  This hillariously uses *a* light as a creative element, if you get my distinction.</td>', 'EXCELLENT title!  Very graphic, dynamic composition.  Meets the challenge, but doesn''t rise to the challenge in the sense of using light*ing* as a creative element.  This hillariously uses *a* light as a creative element, if you get my distinction.', '2006-10-18 11:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940059, 412511, 52854, '<td valign="top">Nice light &amp; color!</td>', 'Nice light & color!', '2006-10-18 11:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940060, 412720, 52854, '<td valign="top">Kewl shot! Interesting. Great light &amp; color!</td>', 'Kewl shot! Interesting. Great light & color!', '2006-10-18 11:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940064, 412540, 52854, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!</td>', 'Nice photo!', '2006-10-18 11:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940065, 412127, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2006-10-18 11:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940066, 413316, 18868, '<td valign="top">I get what you were doing (or at least trying to justify with the title) but having such a large, foreground element so very out of focus isn''t particularly appealing.  If you''d cropped the man just to the left of the tie, perhaps it would improve the compositon??</td>', 'I get what you were doing (or at least trying to justify with the title) but having such a large, foreground element so very out of focus isn''t particularly appealing.  If you''d cropped the man just to the left of the tie, perhaps it would improve the compositon??', '2006-10-18 11:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940067, 412314, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great light!</td>', 'Great light!', '2006-10-18 11:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940071, 412799, 18868, '<td valign="top">Spectacular bokeh!</td>', 'Spectacular bokeh!', '2006-10-18 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940075, 412511, 18868, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The colors are fab, as well.</td>', 'Very nice!  The colors are fab, as well.', '2006-10-18 11:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940080, 413089, 18868, '<td valign="top">Good concept, nice execution (no pun intended).  I find the diagonal streaks (lens flare?) distracting.</td>', 'Good concept, nice execution (no pun intended).  I find the diagonal streaks (lens flare?) distracting.', '2006-10-18 11:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940085, 413162, 18868, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Probably isn''t going to break any records, but I **love** the concept.  As a person who doesn''t watch broadcast TV, I like the title.</td>', 'Awesome!  Probably isn''t going to break any records, but I **love** the concept.  As a person who doesn''t watch broadcast TV, I like the title.', '2006-10-18 11:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940092, 410594, 18868, '<td valign="top">NICE.  I like the PWL because it adds quite a bit of interest to what would be a very ordinary shot without it.</td>', 'NICE.  I like the PWL because it adds quite a bit of interest to what would be a very ordinary shot without it.', '2006-10-18 11:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940097, 413237, 18868, '<td valign="top">REALLY NICE.  I particulary like the reflection.  It has a very organic look that is in nice contrast with the very geometric look of the bulb.</td>', 'REALLY NICE.  I particulary like the reflection.  It has a very organic look that is in nice contrast with the very geometric look of the bulb.', '2006-10-18 11:21:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2940103, 413196, 18868, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  I love the image, although I''m not sure DPC is ready for it.  I''m curious if this was intended in a sci-fi way, or a pre-natal way.  I am also curious about the technique -- it''s flirting with a DQ request.</td>', 'Sweet!  I love the image, although I''m not sure DPC is ready for it.  I''m curious if this was intended in a sci-fi way, or a pre-natal way.  I am also curious about the technique -- it''s flirting with a DQ request.', '2006-10-18 11:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940106, 413096, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Perhaps a tighter, more horizontal crop would even further accentuate the sense of motion.</td>', 'Nice!  Perhaps a tighter, more horizontal crop would even further accentuate the sense of motion.', '2006-10-18 11:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940112, 412454, 40386, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I would have liked to see it shot from a lower perspective which would have silhoueted the splashing water and fishermen a bit higher (hope that makes sense!). Good luck. 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I would have liked to see it shot from a lower perspective which would have silhoueted the splashing water and fishermen a bit higher (hope that makes sense!). Good luck. 8', '2006-10-18 11:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940113, 412689, 36619, '<td valign="top">there is some great detail here, wonderful use of lighting!</td>', 'there is some great detail here, wonderful use of lighting!', '2006-10-18 11:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940118, 410863, 18868, '<td valign="top">The highlights are blown out.  Reducing the exposure by as much as 2 stops might add some dramatic shadows.  A little close at the top, but otherwise, a very nice composition.</td>', 'The highlights are blown out.  Reducing the exposure by as much as 2 stops might add some dramatic shadows.  A little close at the top, but otherwise, a very nice composition.', '2006-10-18 11:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940119, 413254, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice! What a pleasant composition for those falls! Wonderful study in motion and pattern!<br/> <br/>I know exactly where that was taken as I dropped my lens hood into those waters last year about this time....you didn''t see it, did you? ;-)</td>', 'Nice! What a pleasant composition for those falls! Wonderful study in motion and pattern! I know exactly where that was taken as I dropped my lens hood into those waters last year about this time....you didn''t see it, did you? ;-)', '2006-10-18 11:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940124, 411407, 36619, '<td valign="top">great use of lighting, wonderful for the challenge!</td>', 'great use of lighting, wonderful for the challenge!', '2006-10-18 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940130, 413251, 18868, '<td valign="top">I think I took a pic from the same perspective last time I was there.  :)</td>', 'I think I took a pic from the same perspective last time I was there.  :)', '2006-10-18 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940133, 413056, 18868, '<td valign="top">You''ll be scored better if you use the full 640 px. available to you.</td>', 'You''ll be scored better if you use the full 640 px. available to you.', '2006-10-18 11:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940136, 410665, 18868, '<td valign="top">It would have been really, really cool if you could have captured a blurred needle racing toward redline!  Technically very competent image.</td>', 'It would have been really, really cool if you could have captured a blurred needle racing toward redline!  Technically very competent image.', '2006-10-18 11:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940141, 410809, 18868, '<td valign="top">Pretty image, but the tilt is distracting.</td>', 'Pretty image, but the tilt is distracting.', '2006-10-18 11:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940143, 411555, 18868, '<td valign="top">Welcome to the top 30!  Nice!</td>', 'Welcome to the top 30!  Nice!', '2006-10-18 11:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940147, 409939, 18868, '<td valign="top">really, really super image!  I''d like to see just a little more white space at the top above the paw.  You''d probably get a few sales as a print.</td>', 'really, really super image!  I''d like to see just a little more white space at the top above the paw.  You''d probably get a few sales as a print.', '2006-10-18 11:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940156, 413117, 18868, '<td valign="top">the title is a little wordy, but the image makes a nice statement.</td>', 'the title is a little wordy, but the image makes a nice statement.', '2006-10-18 11:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940174, 413097, 39825, '<td valign="top">wow, my favourite until now! 10 points!</td>', 'wow, my favourite until now! 10 points!', '2006-10-18 11:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940179, 412777, 63703, '<td valign="top">This is quite spectacular ! How do you get the whole bar to glow !?</td>', 'This is quite spectacular ! How do you get the whole bar to glow !?', '2006-10-18 11:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940182, 410627, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice i wish there was a bit of light in the foreground to draw you into the photo</td>', 'nice i wish there was a bit of light in the foreground to draw you into the photo', '2006-10-18 11:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940187, 412984, 29293, '<td valign="top">nice dreamy composition</td>', 'nice dreamy composition', '2006-10-18 11:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940189, 413275, 29293, '<td valign="top">a bit too hot</td>', 'a bit too hot', '2006-10-18 11:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940195, 413224, 39825, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2006-10-18 11:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940196, 413253, 18868, '<td valign="top">This is the DPC Police!  Put down the sharpening and come out with your hands up!  Just teasing... but definitely use less sharpening, and try playing with the settings -- if you''re using Pshop, both the "amount" and "radius" are too much.  Visit the tutorial section.</td>', 'This is the DPC Police!  Put down the sharpening and come out with your hands up!  Just teasing... but definitely use less sharpening, and try playing with the settings -- if you''re using Pshop, both the "amount" and "radius" are too much.  Visit the tutorial section.', '2006-10-18 11:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940207, 410693, 18868, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  My only suggestion would be to crop the bottom so it''s symetrical.  Definitely in my top 20.</td>', 'Sweet!  My only suggestion would be to crop the bottom so it''s symetrical.  Definitely in my top 20.', '2006-10-18 11:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940211, 409931, 29293, '<td valign="top">i like the light but not the desat on them</td>', 'i like the light but not the desat on them', '2006-10-18 11:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2940215, 410815, 18868, '<td valign="top">Use the full 640 pixel size.  The door frame on the left can be cropped out.  The lighting would have been more interesting if it weren''t pointed straight at the camera, but instead, at the subject.  Just trying to help.</td>', 'Use the full 640 pixel size.  The door frame on the left can be cropped out.  The lighting would have been more interesting if it weren''t pointed straight at the camera, but instead, at the subject.  Just trying to help.', '2006-10-18 11:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
