(2942077, 412728, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  What keeps it from really getting me excited is the weird perspective problems.  Left side of the door frame is off kilter, top is off kilter, right side is vertically correct.  So basically, the smallest section of the background is the one that is nicely lined up.  Might have worked better if the left side where your subject is was straight up.  Believe this is a function of the angle you held your camera at and the distance you were from the door given the focl length of your lense.  but whatever, I''ll leave the physics to someone who knows.  It just bothers my eyes.  Other than that, the lighting itself is nice and well captured.  Good job.</td>', 'I like this shot.  What keeps it from really getting me excited is the weird perspective problems.  Left side of the door frame is off kilter, top is off kilter, right side is vertically correct.  So basically, the smallest section of the background is the one that is nicely lined up.  Might have worked better if the left side where your subject is was straight up.  Believe this is a function of the angle you held your camera at and the distance you were from the door given the focl length of your lense.  but whatever, I''ll leave the physics to someone who knows.  It just bothers my eyes.  Other than that, the lighting itself is nice and well captured.  Good job.', '2006-10-18 22:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942081, 412654, 23484, '<td valign="top">Supurb job. The light just seems like it will wisk you away.10</td>', 'Supurb job. The light just seems like it will wisk you away.10', '2006-10-18 22:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
