(2942898, 413005, 62187, '<td valign="top">They give us a chance to be creative and most people blew it...not you...rather then take the obvious and use natural or indoor lighting...I see something different here. I think you''ve placed your camera on something that swivels and exposed it to a lightbulb and saturated to blue. However you did it, I like it. I''m not voting this time around but I''d have given you a 10.</td>', 'They give us a chance to be creative and most people blew it...not you...rather then take the obvious and use natural or indoor lighting...I see something different here. I think you''ve placed your camera on something that swivels and exposed it to a lightbulb and saturated to blue. However you did it, I like it. I''m not voting this time around but I''d have given you a 10.', '2006-10-19 02:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942899, 413056, 31637, '<td valign="top">nice dog...good title</td>', 'nice dog...good title', '2006-10-19 02:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942902, 413120, 62187, '<td valign="top">Thanks for finding something interesting to look at. They give us the chance to use lighting, which we undoubtedley have to use in every photo and instead of being creative, most people blew it by choosing something ordinary. I''m not voting but if I was, I''d have given your photo a 10...the tilt is extra creative where I normally like level objects.</td>', 'Thanks for finding something interesting to look at. They give us the chance to use lighting, which we undoubtedley have to use in every photo and instead of being creative, most people blew it by choosing something ordinary. I''m not voting but if I was, I''d have given your photo a 10...the tilt is extra creative where I normally like level objects.', '2006-10-19 02:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942904, 412785, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting but at least your photo is something of an unusual light source...and colorful too.</td>', 'I''m not voting but at least your photo is something of an unusual light source...and colorful too.', '2006-10-19 02:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942906, 411863, 62187, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting but your photo is great...I''d have given it a 10.</td>', 'I''m not voting but your photo is great...I''d have given it a 10.', '2006-10-19 02:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942910, 412604, 62187, '<td valign="top">This looks very creative but beyond basic editing. I''m not voting but if I was, I''d give it a 9...not a 10 because I have my doubts.</td>', 'This looks very creative but beyond basic editing. I''m not voting but if I was, I''d give it a 9...not a 10 because I have my doubts.', '2006-10-19 02:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942912, 412654, 62187, '<td valign="top">I used to see these lights when I lived in Labrador...very nice and thanks for the capture. I''m not voting this time around but I would have given you a 10. You''re lucky to live somewhere to take advantage of the Northern Lights...</td>', 'I used to see these lights when I lived in Labrador...very nice and thanks for the capture. I''m not voting this time around but I would have given you a 10. You''re lucky to live somewhere to take advantage of the Northern Lights...', '2006-10-19 02:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942915, 413037, 31637, '<td valign="top">yea, I try to wake up on the right side of the bed whenever I can. Nice shot !</td>', 'yea, I try to wake up on the right side of the bed whenever I can. Nice shot !', '2006-10-19 02:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942918, 413335, 31637, '<td valign="top">wow, you sure did one up here ! This is awesome..too bad for that post in the lower third. great clouds ! 7</td>', 'wow, you sure did one up here ! This is awesome..too bad for that post in the lower third. great clouds ! 7', '2006-10-19 02:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942919, 413235, 31637, '<td valign="top">now that is one sky that I like ! I dont like many sky photos. The dark foreground hinders the impact of the photo because if their were actual footballers on the field playing, the impact would of been a bit more dramatic. 6</td>', 'now that is one sky that I like ! I dont like many sky photos. The dark foreground hinders the impact of the photo because if their were actual footballers on the field playing, the impact would of been a bit more dramatic. 6', '2006-10-19 02:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942944, 412929, 36619, '<td valign="top">cool image, very interesting!</td>', 'cool image, very interesting!', '2006-10-19 03:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942946, 411862, 36619, '<td valign="top">there''s not one thing i dislike about it, it''s great!</td>', 'there''s not one thing i dislike about it, it''s great!', '2006-10-19 03:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942951, 411407, 57413, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  This is what lighting is all about.  Beautifully done.</td>', 'I really like this.  This is what lighting is all about.  Beautifully done.', '2006-10-19 03:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942956, 413044, 57413, '<td valign="top">This is another example of a photographer who gets it.  This is beautifully done.  I like the choice of lighting color, and I''m glad we don''t know what the subject''s surroundings are.  Sweet.</td>', 'This is another example of a photographer who gets it.  This is beautifully done.  I like the choice of lighting color, and I''m glad we don''t know what the subject''s surroundings are.  Sweet.', '2006-10-19 03:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942959, 410627, 57413, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t quite sure about this at first, but the more I looked at it, the more I wanted to be there.  It draws you in.  Nice job and well done.</td>', 'I wasn''t quite sure about this at first, but the more I looked at it, the more I wanted to be there.  It draws you in.  Nice job and well done.', '2006-10-19 03:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2942961, 412984, 57413, '<td valign="top">This will probably get a ribbon.  A little common with the theme, but no doubt, the lighting is perfect and the clarity is riviting.  Nice job.</td>', 'This will probably get a ribbon.  A little common with the theme, but no doubt, the lighting is perfect and the clarity is riviting.  Nice job.', '2006-10-19 03:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
