(2943028, 412485, 46598, '<td valign="top">I get the picture, I think, but not the title. Why is he a bourgeois? Is he the gigolo for the bourgeois woman? anyhow.. the lighting is nice, but there could be work on the framing and composition.</td>', 'I get the picture, I think, but not the title. Why is he a bourgeois? Is he the gigolo for the bourgeois woman? anyhow.. the lighting is nice, but there could be work on the framing and composition.', '2006-10-19 04:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943030, 411067, 66201, '<td valign="top">super clarity and depth of field - like the sun on the water only ie. hidden from view.</td>', 'super clarity and depth of field - like the sun on the water only ie. hidden from view.', '2006-10-19 04:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943034, 411781, 46598, '<td valign="top">Nice light, very soft.</td>', 'Nice light, very soft.', '2006-10-19 04:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943041, 410554, 46598, '<td valign="top">...I''m not even quite sure what this is... interesting though.</td>', '...I''m not even quite sure what this is... interesting though.', '2006-10-19 04:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943057, 412507, 46598, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, cool concept. But I think it needs work on the completion.<br/> <br/>I think it could be done beter. If you turn the computer screen more around so we don''t actually see the screen (which is quite dirty). Also, the model (you??), take your right hand away from the computer keyboard, so it''s just you leaning on your left hand... really diving into the screen.<br/> <br/>If I''m being overly critical, it''s bacause I really like the idea. ;)</td>', 'I like the idea, cool concept. But I think it needs work on the completion. I think it could be done beter. If you turn the computer screen more around so we don''t actually see the screen (which is quite dirty). Also, the model (you??), take your right hand away from the computer keyboard, so it''s just you leaning on your left hand... really diving into the screen. If I''m being overly critical, it''s bacause I really like the idea. ;)', '2006-10-19 04:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943065, 412994, 46598, '<td valign="top">This is more about shutter speed than light... it''s a gray day in the picture and it doesn''t really feel like Fall at all. Maybe try in the morning with a warm soft sun.</td>', 'This is more about shutter speed than light... it''s a gray day in the picture and it doesn''t really feel like Fall at all. Maybe try in the morning with a warm soft sun.', '2006-10-19 04:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2943071, 411909, 46598, '<td valign="top">Hey that''s a South African flower, right? I remember seeing one of those at the Freedom Day celebrations here in Shanghai...</td>', 'Hey that''s a South African flower, right? I remember seeing one of those at the Freedom Day celebrations here in Shanghai...', '2006-10-19 04:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
