(2943368, 411555, 52296, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot , I dit also take a picture of a tent with light in it but I dit''nt submit it, yours is much better, good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful shot , I dit also take a picture of a tent with light in it but I dit''nt submit it, yours is much better, good luck!', '2006-10-19 09:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
