(2944070, 412306, 64175, '<td valign="top">The model is pretty and though there are various areas of increased/decreased lighting, I don''t really like where the lighting is hitting (fings and left of head).  The bright sunlight forming the dot to the left side draws my eyes there (to a wood pole) first rather than to the model as the subject. There is also a bright dot on the head/hair rather than one near the face that would draw me to the subjects'' face.<br/> <br/>This is a great composition and a nice portrait but the lighting just needs to be adjusted a bit IMO.</td>', 'The model is pretty and though there are various areas of increased/decreased lighting, I don''t really like where the lighting is hitting (fings and left of head).  The bright sunlight forming the dot to the left side draws my eyes there (to a wood pole) first rather than to the model as the subject. There is also a bright dot on the head/hair rather than one near the face that would draw me to the subjects'' face. This is a great composition and a nice portrait but the lighting just needs to be adjusted a bit IMO.', '2006-10-19 14:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
