(2944534, 412986, 58610, '<td valign="top">Not often that a direct shot into the sun works, and this is better than most, but even here it ovepowers everything else in the photo. Backlighting on the columns would help balance the picture.</td>', 'Not often that a direct shot into the sun works, and this is better than most, but even here it ovepowers everything else in the photo. Backlighting on the columns would help balance the picture.', '2006-10-19 16:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944543, 412285, 55956, '<td valign="top">isn''t easy to rate this image. it''s in the contest, it have a good composition, good colours but it haven''t an evident point where there is the focus. Is an abstract and hence I am sure that this is a your choice and isn''t a technical error. I rate it 9 instead 10 for this my doubt.</td>', 'isn''t easy to rate this image. it''s in the contest, it have a good composition, good colours but it haven''t an evident point where there is the focus. Is an abstract and hence I am sure that this is a your choice and isn''t a technical error. I rate it 9 instead 10 for this my doubt.', '2006-10-19 16:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2944544, 411208, 58610, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I think you missed the shot. The outstretched arm is bathed in the light that should have been highlighting the offered book. Instead, the book is in reflected light and the image ,therefore, loses much of its power.</td>', 'Great idea, but I think you missed the shot. The outstretched arm is bathed in the light that should have been highlighting the offered book. Instead, the book is in reflected light and the image ,therefore, loses much of its power.', '2006-10-19 16:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
