(2944767, 412938, 64446, '<td valign="top">As odd as it could be the posts fit in the composition here (normally I''d say get rid of them) and added a even more surreal feeling to the image.<br/>Very nice you were able to get the green, the bown sun, and some blue sky too (not to mention the stars).</td>', 'As odd as it could be the posts fit in the composition here (normally I''d say get rid of them) and added a even more surreal feeling to the image.Very nice you were able to get the green, the bown sun, and some blue sky too (not to mention the stars).', '2006-10-19 18:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
