(2945048, 413003, 58610, '<td valign="top">This needs some forground detail. Maybe if you took the shot a little earlier in the evening before twilight, or right before sunrise and use a polarizing filter to keep the sky dark.</td>', 'This needs some forground detail. Maybe if you took the shot a little earlier in the evening before twilight, or right before sunrise and use a polarizing filter to keep the sky dark.', '2006-10-19 19:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
