(2946494, 411959, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like this captured moment - it is definitely descriptive of a random moment of an interesting character  - i think it might be more powerful  he is highlighted more in the face - making his expression more visible, drawing the eye in that direction.  I realize this is basic editting and we can''t have everything :)</td>', 'I like this captured moment - it is definitely descriptive of a random moment of an interesting character  - i think it might be more powerful  he is highlighted more in the face - making his expression more visible, drawing the eye in that direction.  I realize this is basic editting and we can''t have everything :)', '2006-10-20 07:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
