(2946515, 413162, 38032, '<td valign="top">It''s funy because when I look at this I start to judge the elements that I see ... like the floor - cool, the person, pretty, the wall art, cool ... the TV is white - cool ... So I step back and try to make sense  of it -- basically there is no real statement here, which I like!!!!  This is reality - assuming someone keeps a clean house and gets immobilized by the TV - which is definitely pretty believable.  Well done - stepping back and taking a pic about ... light.</td>', 'It''s funy because when I look at this I start to judge the elements that I see ... like the floor - cool, the person, pretty, the wall art, cool ... the TV is white - cool ... So I step back and try to make sense  of it -- basically there is no real statement here, which I like!!!!  This is reality - assuming someone keeps a clean house and gets immobilized by the TV - which is definitely pretty believable.  Well done - stepping back and taking a pic about ... light.', '2006-10-20 08:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2946519, 413208, 38032, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty shell and the interesting textures are there.  The lighting is interesting - but a non-centered composition would be more interesting  and maybe the rocks on the base just seem too manufactured, too set-up - which they are i suppose.</td>', 'That''s a pretty shell and the interesting textures are there.  The lighting is interesting - but a non-centered composition would be more interesting  and maybe the rocks on the base just seem too manufactured, too set-up - which they are i suppose.', '2006-10-20 08:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
