(2948734, 410713, 66967, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.Different from a lot of city views, I like the olive color of the sky, and the all white lights.Well done.</td>', 'I really like this shot.Different from a lot of city views, I like the olive color of the sky, and the all white lights.Well done.', '2006-10-21 10:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2948735, 413193, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww.   Sparky is so cute. . . .   He has the exact same coloring as my cocker spaniel.  Even the brown patch over one eye.    Tee hee. . .my little 2-year old granddaughter is watching me vote, and told me she "wants to go see her" :)</td>', 'Awwwwww.   Sparky is so cute. . . .   He has the exact same coloring as my cocker spaniel.  Even the brown patch over one eye.    Tee hee. . .my little 2-year old granddaughter is watching me vote, and told me she "wants to go see her" :)', '2006-10-21 10:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2948736, 411978, 24454, '<td valign="top">Amazing!</td>', 'Amazing!', '2006-10-21 10:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2948737, 412371, 66967, '<td valign="top">Very good perspective! The center line leads the eye right to the gate. Very nice!</td>', 'Very good perspective! The center line leads the eye right to the gate. Very nice!', '2006-10-21 10:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2948740, 412801, 24454, '<td valign="top">How sad!  Maria was so young when she died.  <br/> <br/>It is in fact very nicely lit for this photo!  Good luck.</td>', 'How sad!  Maria was so young when she died.   It is in fact very nicely lit for this photo!  Good luck.', '2006-10-21 10:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
