(2948748, 411959, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this!   What a cool photo!   It would be interesting too to see what you could do with it in advanced editing.  Great job.</td>', 'I love the lighting in this!   What a cool photo!   It would be interesting too to see what you could do with it in advanced editing.  Great job.', '2006-10-21 10:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
