(2948759, 413018, 24454, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling people are either going to love this or kill you with their vote.   There''s something about it that I happen to love and find very striking.    I think I might like it even more if there wasn''t any pink on the left at all, but I really do like it alot anyway.  Best of luck.  8</td>', 'I have a feeling people are either going to love this or kill you with their vote.   There''s something about it that I happen to love and find very striking.    I think I might like it even more if there wasn''t any pink on the left at all, but I really do like it alot anyway.  Best of luck.  8', '2006-10-21 10:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2948760, 412781, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!    I love that misty foggy look. . .and its even prettier in the sunrise pink glow.   Great job.  9</td>', 'This is beautiful!    I love that misty foggy look. . .and its even prettier in the sunrise pink glow.   Great job.  9', '2006-10-21 10:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
