(2949079, 411217, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting, but don''t love the composition. Looks a little too centered to me. 6.</td>', 'I love the lighting, but don''t love the composition. Looks a little too centered to me. 6.', '2006-10-21 14:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
