(2949106, 411863, 65858, '<td valign="top">I didn''t quite get it, but then I read the title.  =)  That''s funny!  Crisp shot, nice light emulation.  Good work!</td>', 'I didn''t quite get it, but then I read the title.  =)  That''s funny!  Crisp shot, nice light emulation.  Good work!', '2006-10-21 14:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949109, 410863, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Crisp and clean.  I might have liked the bucket alone because the three in front have different light levels.  There''s another (sepia) apple shot in this contest - I like them both, but I think his presentation is a little better.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Crisp and clean.  I might have liked the bucket alone because the three in front have different light levels.  There''s another (sepia) apple shot in this contest - I like them both, but I think his presentation is a little better.', '2006-10-21 14:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949111, 412777, 65858, '<td valign="top">That''s neat!  Is there a flashlight below?  Nice complementary colors.</td>', 'That''s neat!  Is there a flashlight below?  Nice complementary colors.', '2006-10-21 14:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949118, 413250, 66733, '<td valign="top">great contrast in the textures and the lighting !</td>', 'great contrast in the textures and the lighting !', '2006-10-21 14:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949121, 412039, 65858, '<td valign="top">Great shot - very well done!  I like the lighting, and good choice with the sepia.</td>', 'Great shot - very well done!  I like the lighting, and good choice with the sepia.', '2006-10-21 14:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949128, 412787, 65858, '<td valign="top">I think this was a good idea, but it''s just not there technically.  The focus is soft, and the candle flare is in a bit of an awkward place.</td>', 'I think this was a good idea, but it''s just not there technically.  The focus is soft, and the candle flare is in a bit of an awkward place.', '2006-10-21 14:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949132, 411856, 65858, '<td valign="top">cool silhouette</td>', 'cool silhouette', '2006-10-21 14:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949133, 412587, 65858, '<td valign="top">That''s one of the better window reflection shots I''ve seen.  =)  Good work.</td>', 'That''s one of the better window reflection shots I''ve seen.  =)  Good work.', '2006-10-21 14:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949134, 409967, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Unfortunately, I think camera noise (or a small crop) may cost you here.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Unfortunately, I think camera noise (or a small crop) may cost you here.', '2006-10-21 14:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949138, 413316, 65858, '<td valign="top">I think a photo with the majority blurred isn''t going to do well here.  But I think it''s very artistic.</td>', 'I think a photo with the majority blurred isn''t going to do well here.  But I think it''s very artistic.', '2006-10-21 15:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949182, 412039, 28742, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect! There is nothing I do not like about this. Only my second vote, but already I predict a top ten if not a ribbon.</td>', 'Absolutely perfect! There is nothing I do not like about this. Only my second vote, but already I predict a top ten if not a ribbon.', '2006-10-21 15:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949184, 410693, 28742, '<td valign="top">Of course I come across an image like this when I about used up my ribbon predictions! Now I have to go back and reassess the others cuz you have just raised the bar! Stunning, magnificent and yes, I predict a ribbon. 10</td>', 'Of course I come across an image like this when I about used up my ribbon predictions! Now I have to go back and reassess the others cuz you have just raised the bar! Stunning, magnificent and yes, I predict a ribbon. 10', '2006-10-21 15:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949186, 412131, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very soft. Maybe intentional, but doesn''t work for me. Also seems to have a yellowish cast to it. Crop is the strongest attribute here. Best of luck.</td>', 'Very soft. Maybe intentional, but doesn''t work for me. Also seems to have a yellowish cast to it. Crop is the strongest attribute here. Best of luck.', '2006-10-21 15:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949195, 411507, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Painterly! :)</td>', 'Very cool! Painterly! :)', '2006-10-21 15:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949197, 413254, 28742, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely intersting, but I have no idea what I am looking at. If the image was split by the top third and the bottom two thirds, you would never guess they were part of the same scene. And other than the "ghost", the top third is the most appealing part of the image. Good capture though - I look forward to the explanation. :)</td>', 'It''s definitely intersting, but I have no idea what I am looking at. If the image was split by the top third and the bottom two thirds, you would never guess they were part of the same scene. And other than the "ghost", the top third is the most appealing part of the image. Good capture though - I look forward to the explanation. :)', '2006-10-21 15:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949204, 409939, 28742, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I might have dismissed it as a bad, blurry, blown out image of a cat. Beyond the first glance though, the focal point on the face does grab my attention and suddenly the image comes to life. Great job! I''m not fond of the thick border. A simpler thin border using one of the medium tones from the cat''s fur might work better, IMO. Best of luck! :)</td>', 'At first glance, I might have dismissed it as a bad, blurry, blown out image of a cat. Beyond the first glance though, the focal point on the face does grab my attention and suddenly the image comes to life. Great job! I''m not fond of the thick border. A simpler thin border using one of the medium tones from the cat''s fur might work better, IMO. Best of luck! :)', '2006-10-21 16:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949211, 413325, 28742, '<td valign="top">The concept is great, but the pattern created doesn''t quite make the grade. Very difficult to do, so cheers for the effort. Overall it''s still a likeable image.</td>', 'The concept is great, but the pattern created doesn''t quite make the grade. Very difficult to do, so cheers for the effort. Overall it''s still a likeable image.', '2006-10-21 16:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949227, 413202, 15568, '<td valign="top">Very cool</td>', 'Very cool', '2006-10-21 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949228, 410713, 15568, '<td valign="top">almost seems a wintry sky</td>', 'almost seems a wintry sky', '2006-10-21 16:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949229, 412371, 28742, '<td valign="top">Black &amp; White would''ve worked much better here, IMO. Nice shot though.</td>', 'Black & White would''ve worked much better here, IMO. Nice shot though.', '2006-10-21 16:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949230, 411407, 15568, '<td valign="top">have seen and taken many horse pics, but this is special</td>', 'have seen and taken many horse pics, but this is special', '2006-10-21 16:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
