(2949255, 411737, 28742, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and appealing colors! I will probably not be the only one who suggests this would be better in portrait orientation, but if I am, I guess I''m a rebel. :)</td>', 'Very interesting and appealing colors! I will probably not be the only one who suggests this would be better in portrait orientation, but if I am, I guess I''m a rebel. :)', '2006-10-21 16:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949257, 413269, 28742, '<td valign="top">I could be wrong, but predict this may be up for debate on the Literal Artwork rule. Who knows these days though. Personally, the colors don''t work for me. BW might make a huge difference. Good luck.</td>', 'I could be wrong, but predict this may be up for debate on the Literal Artwork rule. Who knows these days though. Personally, the colors don''t work for me. BW might make a huge difference. Good luck.', '2006-10-21 16:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949266, 411646, 28742, '<td valign="top">This totally reminds me of a 50''s horror movie about a guy that gets radiated and his touch becomes deadly and leaves a glowing green handprint on the victim. Of course he goes mad and starts killing people until he burns up at the end.<br/> <br/>...oh yeah, the pic - Hmmm, I assume it''s legal - painted with a laser pointer or something? It is interesting and entertaining, but not that appealing. As long as you had fun (and the dog survived), it''s all good. :)</td>', 'This totally reminds me of a 50''s horror movie about a guy that gets radiated and his touch becomes deadly and leaves a glowing green handprint on the victim. Of course he goes mad and starts killing people until he burns up at the end. ...oh yeah, the pic - Hmmm, I assume it''s legal - painted with a laser pointer or something? It is interesting and entertaining, but not that appealing. As long as you had fun (and the dog survived), it''s all good. :)', '2006-10-21 16:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949269, 413305, 28742, '<td valign="top">Only thing missing is the platter! ;-)</td>', 'Only thing missing is the platter! ;-)', '2006-10-21 16:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949271, 413294, 28742, '<td valign="top">Have a cigar you''re gonna go far... :) Cute &amp; well done.</td>', 'Have a cigar you''re gonna go far... :) Cute & well done.', '2006-10-21 16:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949272, 413008, 28742, '<td valign="top">Ummm, hate to tell you this, but Bob moved down the street about six months ago. This is Jeb''s house, but you''ll notice his Camaro is gone so you''ll probably find him down at Tiny''s Pub. :D<br/> <br/>Nice pic, good lighting, intersting composition, lacks major WOW, but it would have had that if you shot Bob''s NEW house. ;-) Best of luck.</td>', 'Ummm, hate to tell you this, but Bob moved down the street about six months ago. This is Jeb''s house, but you''ll notice his Camaro is gone so you''ll probably find him down at Tiny''s Pub. :D Nice pic, good lighting, intersting composition, lacks major WOW, but it would have had that if you shot Bob''s NEW house. ;-) Best of luck.', '2006-10-21 16:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2949273, 412929, 28742, '<td valign="top">Interesting! That bright spot on the wall behind makes it look like the cat''s ass is on fire - or smoldering at least. :P <br/>Overall excellent job - lots to look at, but it is pulled together by the dark feel. Good luck.</td>', 'Interesting! That bright spot on the wall behind makes it look like the cat''s ass is on fire - or smoldering at least. :P Overall excellent job - lots to look at, but it is pulled together by the dark feel. Good luck.', '2006-10-21 16:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
