(2951730, 411863, 61818, '<td valign="top">Cool photo but really whatever the stuff is cluttering up the foreground breaks it.  More bananas maybe?  Whatever they are, they add nothing and they block the view of the nicely lit main subject.  Remove the obstructions and this photo scores much, much better.  Good luck.</td>', 'Cool photo but really whatever the stuff is cluttering up the foreground breaks it.  More bananas maybe?  Whatever they are, they add nothing and they block the view of the nicely lit main subject.  Remove the obstructions and this photo scores much, much better.  Good luck.', '2006-10-22 17:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
