(2951752, 412584, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.  Two sources of light, so the WPL people would say this is a dnmc.  That''s what I''d get if I put up this photo.  Just to let you know I''m not one of those WPL jerks, I am scoring this a "10".</td>', 'Excellent photo.  Two sources of light, so the WPL people would say this is a dnmc.  That''s what I''d get if I put up this photo.  Just to let you know I''m not one of those WPL jerks, I am scoring this a "10".', '2006-10-22 18:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
