(2952382, 413097, 33560, '<td valign="top">I am impressed with the use of line as well as the use of light. For instance, I love how the telephone pole looms menacingly and the stripe leads the eye into the dark.   Finally, I love how well you tell a story with such a small part of the photo. Great shot.</td>', 'I am impressed with the use of line as well as the use of light. For instance, I love how the telephone pole looms menacingly and the stripe leads the eye into the dark.   Finally, I love how well you tell a story with such a small part of the photo. Great shot.', '2006-10-22 22:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2952392, 410647, 33560, '<td valign="top">For some time I imagined the photo to be ironically titled.  I like the moody, grainy sense and the glowing bits from the light.  I don''t find the placement of the light in the photo to work well for me, and I kind of wish I could see a little less of the BG.</td>', 'For some time I imagined the photo to be ironically titled.  I like the moody, grainy sense and the glowing bits from the light.  I don''t find the placement of the light in the photo to work well for me, and I kind of wish I could see a little less of the BG.', '2006-10-22 23:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
