(2954705, 411318, 66201, '<td valign="top">This has a frightening undertone: is it the swirling dark water in the foreground? I feel panicky "standing" here in the water viewing the plumber who is on safer ground. Great use of lighting.</td>', 'This has a frightening undertone: is it the swirling dark water in the foreground? I feel panicky "standing" here in the water viewing the plumber who is on safer ground. Great use of lighting.', '2006-10-23 15:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
