(2954738, 411951, 66201, '<td valign="top">great idea: I would have liked more light to wrap around the back of the dog a bit: I spent a few moments trying to work out the subject. Once I got it was a dog, I thought it was a great picture, but you don''t want to aggrivate the viewer: you want to draw the viewer in.</td>', 'great idea: I would have liked more light to wrap around the back of the dog a bit: I spent a few moments trying to work out the subject. Once I got it was a dog, I thought it was a great picture, but you don''t want to aggrivate the viewer: you want to draw the viewer in.', '2006-10-23 15:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2954740, 412833, 66201, '<td valign="top">yes, yes, yes, another Northern Lights picture, very nice: but it''s been done SO often.</td>', 'yes, yes, yes, another Northern Lights picture, very nice: but it''s been done SO often.', '2006-10-23 15:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
