(2955283, 412654, 66267, '<td valign="top">One of the greatest (if not THE greatest) aurora shots i have ever seen in my entire life, and I have seen countless. The gentle wisps of the aurora are beautifully captured, and the stars in the background is the icing on the cake. Excellent clarity.<br/> <br/>Aurora shots are very difficult, and you pulled it off perfectly.<br/> <br/>10/10</td>', 'One of the greatest (if not THE greatest) aurora shots i have ever seen in my entire life, and I have seen countless. The gentle wisps of the aurora are beautifully captured, and the stars in the background is the icing on the cake. Excellent clarity. Aurora shots are very difficult, and you pulled it off perfectly. 10/10', '2006-10-23 18:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
