(2957108, 410713, 15711, '<td valign="top">Makes me think of Gotham City.  Great brooding tones with the vivid lights of the buildings.  I especially like the pointed one with the flare coming out of it.  Nice work. 8</td>', 'Makes me think of Gotham City.  Great brooding tones with the vivid lights of the buildings.  I especially like the pointed one with the flare coming out of it.  Nice work. 8', '2006-10-24 10:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957110, 411346, 57229, '<td valign="top">All the collected elements of clothes and make up and pose and on and on - even the lighting, although that''s probably less significant than it could have been for the challenge - are very lovely and so''s the model, but in the end it does not depart at all from <b>someone posing for a picture</b>, which drags you down to 6 on my little scale here.</td>', 'All the collected elements of clothes and make up and pose and on and on - even the lighting, although that''s probably less significant than it could have been for the challenge - are very lovely and so''s the model, but in the end it does not depart at all from someone posing for a picture, which drags you down to 6 on my little scale here.', '2006-10-24 10:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
