(2957466, 412833, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhhhh. . .I am SOOO JEALOUS!   I have always wanted to see this!  You are so lucky!  Thank you for sharing that awe-inspiring scene.  It may be the closest I ever get to it!   I love this!  Love it!  10</td>', 'Ohhhhhhh. . .I am SOOO JEALOUS!   I have always wanted to see this!  You are so lucky!  Thank you for sharing that awe-inspiring scene.  It may be the closest I ever get to it!   I love this!  Love it!  10', '2006-10-24 12:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957469, 412689, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is GOOD!  And these types of photos go over so well here on dpc (with reason).   My guess is this photo is doing very well.  As it should be.  And my vote will certainly help it along!  I vote 9, only because the light may be just a teeeeeeny little bit too bright, but definitely doesn''t detract much!   Fantastic job!</td>', 'Oh, this is GOOD!  And these types of photos go over so well here on dpc (with reason).   My guess is this photo is doing very well.  As it should be.  And my vote will certainly help it along!  I vote 9, only because the light may be just a teeeeeeny little bit too bright, but definitely doesn''t detract much!   Fantastic job!', '2006-10-24 12:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957472, 412047, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is SO AWESOME!   I LOVE photos like this.  The fog gives it such an ethereal feel!   Think I better add this one to my favorites!  10</td>', 'This is SO AWESOME!   I LOVE photos like this.  The fog gives it such an ethereal feel!   Think I better add this one to my favorites!  10', '2006-10-24 12:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
