(2957579, 411863, 50695, '<td valign="top">This photograph<br/> <br/>1) fulfills the challenge. the whole atmosphere and illusion is achieved through lighting.<br/> <br/>2) is so damn funny.<br/> <br/>3) might keep me from ever eating a banana again. either that, or make me strangely aroused whenever I do. oh wait, that already happens...<br/> <br/>10) 10</td>', 'This photograph 1) fulfills the challenge. the whole atmosphere and illusion is achieved through lighting. 2) is so damn funny. 3) might keep me from ever eating a banana again. either that, or make me strangely aroused whenever I do. oh wait, that already happens... 10) 10', '2006-10-24 13:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957583, 412929, 50695, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful photo. you have a world of rectangles at exciting angles, some due to perspective, others to orientation, large mysterious areas of darkness with long highlights in them, and you have your subject calmly but alertly centered in all this madness. Oh, and you have light, coming in through the windows. 10</td>', 'what a beautiful photo. you have a world of rectangles at exciting angles, some due to perspective, others to orientation, large mysterious areas of darkness with long highlights in them, and you have your subject calmly but alertly centered in all this madness. Oh, and you have light, coming in through the windows. 10', '2006-10-24 13:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957584, 411335, 66543, '<td valign="top">It obviously is not under control, but it would have been absolutely striking if the church could have been higlighted by the light shining down.</td>', 'It obviously is not under control, but it would have been absolutely striking if the church could have been higlighted by the light shining down.', '2006-10-24 13:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957586, 412889, 50695, '<td valign="top">so elegant, so minimal, but the point is made: something about trying to find beauty on the street. 10</td>', 'so elegant, so minimal, but the point is made: something about trying to find beauty on the street. 10', '2006-10-24 13:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957591, 412986, 66543, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing, it is a shame about the second pillar on the far right.</td>', 'Perfect timing, it is a shame about the second pillar on the far right.', '2006-10-24 13:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957592, 409939, 66543, '<td valign="top">Animal photo''s can be quite ordinary, this is special.</td>', 'Animal photo''s can be quite ordinary, this is special.', '2006-10-24 13:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957596, 413053, 50695, '<td valign="top">you have quite simply transformed this teddy bear into something mysterious and compelling... He and his window(?) are now a landscape, the setting for a controlled explosion of beauty. I''m not sure I like the bottom, where the backlighting and uplighting reveal too much information about the bear. But that''s just a note for future experiments. Showing me something compelling that I''ve never seen before warrants a 10. (but I do think you should keep working on this shot/series. I don''t think you''ve exhausted the possibilities yet)</td>', 'you have quite simply transformed this teddy bear into something mysterious and compelling... He and his window(?) are now a landscape, the setting for a controlled explosion of beauty. I''m not sure I like the bottom, where the backlighting and uplighting reveal too much information about the bear. But that''s just a note for future experiments. Showing me something compelling that I''ve never seen before warrants a 10. (but I do think you should keep working on this shot/series. I don''t think you''ve exhausted the possibilities yet)', '2006-10-24 13:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957597, 410647, 50695, '<td valign="top">graininess, abstraction, what''s not to like? This is mysterious in all the right ways... wait, I see a person there! with a lamp for a head! Man, this is cool. 9</td>', 'graininess, abstraction, what''s not to like? This is mysterious in all the right ways... wait, I see a person there! with a lamp for a head! Man, this is cool. 9', '2006-10-24 13:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957598, 411781, 50695, '<td valign="top">orientation really does make two lights of one light. Very good, creative fulfillment of the challenge. 9</td>', 'orientation really does make two lights of one light. Very good, creative fulfillment of the challenge. 9', '2006-10-24 13:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957599, 413246, 50695, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, wonderfully hidden leopard. It''s the hiding that demonstrates viscerally just how dangerous this creature is. 9</td>', 'Beautiful composition, wonderfully hidden leopard. It''s the hiding that demonstrates viscerally just how dangerous this creature is. 9', '2006-10-24 13:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957600, 411154, 66543, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been more captivating if the eye was highlighted as well.</td>', 'I think it would have been more captivating if the eye was highlighted as well.', '2006-10-24 13:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957605, 412041, 60174, '<td valign="top">love the colors, and nice choice of title.</td>', 'love the colors, and nice choice of title.', '2006-10-24 13:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957606, 413302, 50695, '<td valign="top">the leafage looks like a hand. the left side of the composition is pure light. This is really beautiful. 9</td>', 'the leafage looks like a hand. the left side of the composition is pure light. This is really beautiful. 9', '2006-10-24 13:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957613, 411956, 50695, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a picture of light, it''s a picture of darkness! So why am I giving you a 9? Because there is no darkness without light.</td>', 'This isn''t a picture of light, it''s a picture of darkness! So why am I giving you a 9? Because there is no darkness without light.', '2006-10-24 13:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957614, 412904, 66543, '<td valign="top">The angle is great.</td>', 'The angle is great.', '2006-10-24 13:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957616, 413331, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is almost pure light. fascinating. 8</td>', 'this is almost pure light. fascinating. 8', '2006-10-24 13:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957617, 412485, 50695, '<td valign="top">Entertaining milieu that uses light to create a mood, or at least enhance it, so to speak. 8</td>', 'Entertaining milieu that uses light to create a mood, or at least enhance it, so to speak. 8', '2006-10-24 13:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957620, 413253, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love that 1960s postcard world outside the window. 8</td>', 'I love that 1960s postcard world outside the window. 8', '2006-10-24 13:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957624, 411217, 66543, '<td valign="top">Definitely spooky.</td>', 'Definitely spooky.', '2006-10-24 13:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957625, 411862, 50695, '<td valign="top">excellent fulfillment of challenge with the same light on two planes, one perpendicular to and inside the other. 8</td>', 'excellent fulfillment of challenge with the same light on two planes, one perpendicular to and inside the other. 8', '2006-10-24 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957634, 411296, 50695, '<td valign="top">The tree has curled up to sleep, and the city is its dream. 9</td>', 'The tree has curled up to sleep, and the city is its dream. 9', '2006-10-24 14:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2957642, 411650, 50695, '<td valign="top">lovely recreation of Michelangelo, who was all about light on forms. 8</td>', 'lovely recreation of Michelangelo, who was all about light on forms. 8', '2006-10-24 14:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
