(2957659, 410500, 66543, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been more dramatic if the stem in the foreground was sharper.</td>', 'I think it would have been more dramatic if the stem in the foreground was sharper.', '2006-10-24 14:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
