(2958030, 412889, 33560, '<td valign="top">The diffuse light works wonders in helping us percieve the elegant shape of the pots.  And that gratuitous hubcap adds a sense of whimsy to an otherwise very staid and formal composition.  I like it.</td>', 'The diffuse light works wonders in helping us percieve the elegant shape of the pots.  And that gratuitous hubcap adds a sense of whimsy to an otherwise very staid and formal composition.  I like it.', '2006-10-24 16:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
