(2958067, 413237, 33560, '<td valign="top">The observation that this light looks interesting reflected in this surface is a good one.  I have the sense that the reflection is more interesting than the light itself.  I wonder if you considered the idea of trying to make most of the phot be of reflection ( I assume it is a spoon )  It might have been interesting to have small bits of the original going across a corner of the photo so we know what we are looking at.  Good choice to desaturate.</td>', 'The observation that this light looks interesting reflected in this surface is a good one.  I have the sense that the reflection is more interesting than the light itself.  I wonder if you considered the idea of trying to make most of the phot be of reflection ( I assume it is a spoon )  It might have been interesting to have small bits of the original going across a corner of the photo so we know what we are looking at.  Good choice to desaturate.', '2006-10-24 16:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
