(2958434, 411506, 58610, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the subject.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the subject.', '2006-10-24 19:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958445, 413096, 58610, '<td valign="top">Very bold and active. Lots of imagination and creativity. Really good composition.. Nothing negative at all.</td>', 'Very bold and active. Lots of imagination and creativity. Really good composition.. Nothing negative at all.', '2006-10-24 19:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958451, 410500, 58610, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were after. I think you needed your lighting to be just a little more even throughout. Shadows are just a little dark for me. And, maybe shooting from the other angle so the light is coming through the pages toward the camera. Just a thought.</td>', 'I can see what you were after. I think you needed your lighting to be just a little more even throughout. Shadows are just a little dark for me. And, maybe shooting from the other angle so the light is coming through the pages toward the camera. Just a thought.', '2006-10-24 19:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958457, 412984, 67373, '<td valign="top">wow! great shot! 9!</td>', 'wow! great shot! 9!', '2006-10-24 19:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958461, 411318, 58610, '<td valign="top">Poor guy. I knew there was a reason I didn''t go into that line of work. A plumber needs to know only two things. Effluenece (to avoid the vernacular) doesn''t flow uphill, and payday''s on Friday. I certainly think your picture captures the essence of both.</td>', 'Poor guy. I knew there was a reason I didn''t go into that line of work. A plumber needs to know only two things. Effluenece (to avoid the vernacular) doesn''t flow uphill, and payday''s on Friday. I certainly think your picture captures the essence of both.', '2006-10-24 19:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2958462, 411773, 67373, '<td valign="top">too blurred for me.</td>', 'too blurred for me.', '2006-10-24 19:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
