(2958899, 412808, 40370, '<td valign="top">The duotone coloring is rich but doesn''t show off the lighting choice. I like the intense crispness of the image but the foreground red apple appears a bit oversharpened on the left side. 6</td>', 'The duotone coloring is rich but doesn''t show off the lighting choice. I like the intense crispness of the image but the foreground red apple appears a bit oversharpened on the left side. 6', '2006-10-24 22:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
