(2960840, 412785, 43828, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cogerox:</b></div><hr/><i> Very cute as graphic art, but I don''t see the photographic qualities of depth and texture. Its too flat - like a painting on a wall. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My feelings exactly,  I knew there was something about it that was not good as a photograph, and you nailed it, I like it as a poster just does not have the qualities that you stated. I did this shot by my self using a metal yard art statue that I had built and just traced around all the metal rods that make up the drummer boy, bulb setting, Thanks for the comments it cleared this one up for me.</td>', 'Originally posted by cogerox: Very cute as graphic art, but I don''t see the photographic qualities of depth and texture. Its too flat - like a painting on a wall.   My feelings exactly,  I knew there was something about it that was not good as a photograph, and you nailed it, I like it as a poster just does not have the qualities that you stated. I did this shot by my self using a metal yard art statue that I had built and just traced around all the metal rods that make up the drummer boy, bulb setting, Thanks for the comments it cleared this one up for me.', '2006-10-25 10:29:27.000000', NULL, 0),
