(2961127, 412047, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes it was (worth the trip)!   This remains one of my favorites in this whole beautiful challenge!<br/> <br/>Looks to me like a few jealous trolls thought this picture was a real threat, so the ridiculous votes of 1, 2, 3 or 4????   It''s so blatantly undeserving that you almost have to laugh at them, huh?<br/> <br/>Congratulations on this flawless photo!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Yes it was (worth the trip)!   This remains one of my favorites in this whole beautiful challenge! Looks to me like a few jealous trolls thought this picture was a real threat, so the ridiculous votes of 1, 2, 3 or 4????   It''s so blatantly undeserving that you almost have to laugh at them, huh? Congratulations on this flawless photo! ', '2006-10-25 11:29:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961131, 413098, 30982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful as always, Louis.  You remain the King of Light, regardless of the placement of this.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful as always, Louis.  You remain the King of Light, regardless of the placement of this.', '2006-10-25 11:31:15.000000', NULL, 0);
