(2961241, 413074, 19672, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 16th place!!!<br/> <br/>6.5+ score<br/> <br/>You have officially surpassed me....well in score.  But you''ll probably ribbon soon.<br/> <br/>I myself have just been frustrated cause there have been so many great challenges I''d like to do and absolutely no time. <br/> <br/>:(<br/> <br/>*sighs*</td>', 'Congratulations on your 16th place!!! 6.5+ score You have officially surpassed me....well in score.  But you''ll probably ribbon soon. I myself have just been frustrated cause there have been so many great challenges I''d like to do and absolutely no time.  :( *sighs*', '2006-10-25 12:01:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961310, 412984, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is great. Congrats on the absolutely deserved ribbon. The lighting is amazing, as is the composition in the crop.</td>', 'This is great. Congrats on the absolutely deserved ribbon. The lighting is amazing, as is the composition in the crop.', '2006-10-25 12:18:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961382, 410693, 66038, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos that looks terrific from a distance -with the interesting horizontal band of light and jagged verticals, but it also increases in interest as it is viewed more closely. A true gem for wall hanging. <br/>I love it.</td>', 'This is one of those photos that looks terrific from a distance -with the interesting horizontal band of light and jagged verticals, but it also increases in interest as it is viewed more closely. A true gem for wall hanging. I love it.', '2006-10-25 12:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961385, 412654, 33068, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous work and perfect title.</td>', 'Gorgeous work and perfect title.', '2006-10-25 12:37:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961435, 412047, 55005, '<td valign="top">That cold morning was so worth it -- - this is one of my favorite photos and my personal best.  <br/> <br/>A big thank you goes out to all of you for you time, your votes and your comments.<br/> <br/></td>', 'That cold morning was so worth it -- - this is one of my favorite photos and my personal best.   A big thank you goes out to all of you for you time, your votes and your comments. ', '2006-10-25 12:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961447, 413117, 63824, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SandyP:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh man!  Highly underrated!  I''m sorry.  It deserves a much better score than 5.6!!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hehe thank you I think that too :P</td>', 'Originally posted by SandyP: Oh man!  Highly underrated!  I''m sorry.  It deserves a much better score than 5.6!!!!   hehe thank you I think that too :P', '2006-10-25 12:56:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961484, 411151, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting approach to the topic that suffers from "not enough light" basically; you need, even in this very quiet and subtle scene, some sense of luminosity. I''ve taken the liberty of reprocessing your entry with some levels and curves to get more of that element into it. What do you think?<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=417141" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30861/thumb/417141.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30861/thumb/417141.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30861/thumb/417141.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'This is an interesting approach to the topic that suffers from "not enough light" basically; you need, even in this very quiet and subtle scene, some sense of luminosity. I''ve taken the liberty of reprocessing your entry with some levels and curves to get more of that element into it. What do you think?   R.', '2006-10-25 13:10:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961525, 413076, 66384, '<td valign="top">I loved this portrait. The lighting was very good and the composition, color, and character were excellent. Too bad about the vote.</td>', 'I loved this portrait. The lighting was very good and the composition, color, and character were excellent. Too bad about the vote.', '2006-10-25 13:25:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961589, 411151, 40973, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> This is an interesting approach to the topic that suffers from "not enough light" basically; you need, even in this very quiet and subtle scene, some sense of luminosity. I''ve taken the liberty of reprocessing your entry with some levels and curves to get more of that element into it. What do you think?<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=417141" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30861/thumb/417141.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30861/thumb/417141.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30861/thumb/417141.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>R. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you - that is a beautiful improvement and closer to the quality of light I actually saw.</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: This is an interesting approach to the topic that suffers from "not enough light" basically; you need, even in this very quiet and subtle scene, some sense of luminosity. I''ve taken the liberty of reprocessing your entry with some levels and curves to get more of that element into it. What do you think?   R.   Thank you - that is a beautiful improvement and closer to the quality of light I actually saw.', '2006-10-25 13:40:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961592, 411179, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m stunned by the vote on this. I like it a lot: the light, the composition, the color, the simplicity and originality. Lovely.</td>', 'I''m stunned by the vote on this. I like it a lot: the light, the composition, the color, the simplicity and originality. Lovely.', '2006-10-25 13:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961609, 412984, 52628, '<td valign="top">Til hamingju.  Alltaf gaman að sjá nýtt íslenskt nafn á forsíðu DPC. :)</td>', 'Til hamingju.  Alltaf gaman að sjá nýtt íslenskt nafn á forsíðu DPC. :)', '2006-10-25 13:48:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961613, 412749, 66384, '<td valign="top">What''s the matter with me (or everybody else)? -- I gave this a 9. I like the lighting, the mood, the relaxed but intense (is that possible) expression, and the soft focus.</td>', 'What''s the matter with me (or everybody else)? -- I gave this a 9. I like the lighting, the mood, the relaxed but intense (is that possible) expression, and the soft focus.', '2006-10-25 13:50:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961694, 413104, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this. I don''t see how could be sharper -- every hair is visible in the highlights. It seems a little unballanced, though, heavy on the right. If you don''t LOVE the flowers, try cropping the left side.</td>', 'I like this. I don''t see how could be sharper -- every hair is visible in the highlights. It seems a little unballanced, though, heavy on the right. If you don''t LOVE the flowers, try cropping the left side.', '2006-10-25 14:09:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961701, 410713, 23680, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Tony on your high placement.  This was one of my top picks!</td>', 'Congratulations Tony on your high placement.  This was one of my top picks!', '2006-10-25 14:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961737, 412929, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. I wish I''d see more of these than the ones we know will ribbon.<br/> <br/>I was thinking, more images like this from the top photogs on the site would really help progress the site into more artistic zones.<br/> <br/>AND on that note "..it''s too dark"   "...could be sharper"   "...blown highlights"    "...the cat is a distraction"<br/> <br/>Just kidding of course. Going into the faves.</td>', 'This is a great image. I wish I''d see more of these than the ones we know will ribbon. I was thinking, more images like this from the top photogs on the site would really help progress the site into more artistic zones. AND on that note "..it''s too dark"   "...could be sharper"   "...blown highlights"    "...the cat is a distraction" Just kidding of course. Going into the faves.', '2006-10-25 14:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2961850, 412265, 31403, '<td valign="top">I feel your pain.<br/> <br/>So many of my "middle of the road" DPC images are commercially viable for me.  It leaves me wondering what all this input really buys me - <br/> <br/>Especially when I blur part of the image for effect and then the DOF police come out - am I a better photographer for knowing that some people vote me lower because they don''t agree with my artistic interpretation?<br/> <br/>It''s an interesting place to say the least.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry you feel the need to withdraw, although I totally understand.  I''ve always looked up to you and frequented your portfolio for inspiration.  Thanks for that!</td>', 'I feel your pain. So many of my "middle of the road" DPC images are commercially viable for me.  It leaves me wondering what all this input really buys me -  Especially when I blur part of the image for effect and then the DOF police come out - am I a better photographer for knowing that some people vote me lower because they don''t agree with my artistic interpretation? It''s an interesting place to say the least. I''m sorry you feel the need to withdraw, although I totally understand.  I''ve always looked up to you and frequented your portfolio for inspiration.  Thanks for that!', '2006-10-25 14:35:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2962074, 412533, 62009, '<td valign="top">This is great Chelle.  So alluring and bright.</td>', 'This is great Chelle.  So alluring and bright.', '2006-10-25 15:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2962117, 413108, 40718, '<td valign="top">Another great one Jorge!</td>', 'Another great one Jorge!', '2006-10-25 16:06:24.000000', NULL, 0),
