(2965921, 412595, 67152, '<td valign="top">If you re-crop the photo so that the cat and the light were the main portion of the photo - i think the photo would have come off better.  The blackened right half of the photo make the image seem only half there.  <br/> <br/>The glow in the photo from the light is quite nice, but the composition of the image and distractions such as the lights off the pot on the stove detract from the good stuff. <br/> <br/></td>', 'If you re-crop the photo so that the cat and the light were the main portion of the photo - i think the photo would have come off better.  The blackened right half of the photo make the image seem only half there.   The glow in the photo from the light is quite nice, but the composition of the image and distractions such as the lights off the pot on the stove detract from the good stuff.  ', '2006-10-26 19:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
