(2967123, 412533, 65723, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm,<br/>I''m not sure what others mean about the out of focus or missing side of the nose, etc... I assumed that was the purpose given the intensity of the light.<br/>What struck me right away was the model''s lips, which by the way, in this photo, are simply perfection...  The hidden features of the face, causes me to look a bit closer at her left side. I find mself following the eye, down between the cheek and hairline, then over the thumb, chin and right up into that bold black ring. I like the way the photo makes me look at it in a circular motion without distraction.  In my opinion this is an exceptional photo that leaves the viewer lingering, and wanting more.<br/> <br/>Well done, this is a truly Superb Photo....(that was scored too low)<br/> <br/>/FC</td>', 'Hmmmm,I''m not sure what others mean about the out of focus or missing side of the nose, etc... I assumed that was the purpose given the intensity of the light.What struck me right away was the model''s lips, which by the way, in this photo, are simply perfection...  The hidden features of the face, causes me to look a bit closer at her left side. I find mself following the eye, down between the cheek and hairline, then over the thumb, chin and right up into that bold black ring. I like the way the photo makes me look at it in a circular motion without distraction.  In my opinion this is an exceptional photo that leaves the viewer lingering, and wanting more. Well done, this is a truly Superb Photo....(that was scored too low) /FC', '2006-10-27 03:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2967238, 413224, 64844, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your comments and voting! Still a newcomer at this site, I am very happy with this result and glad that some of you liked it even though it is just another sunset...<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you for all your comments and voting! Still a newcomer at this site, I am very happy with this result and glad that some of you liked it even though it is just another sunset... ', '2006-10-27 06:12:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2967937, 412265, 14476, '<td valign="top">Hello Skip -<br/> <br/>I hope you reconsider your thought of bowing out of competition here at DPC.  Your work is an inspiration to many photographers on the site.  It''s obvious from the feedback you get every time you post!<br/> <br/>Now, I almost never bother looking at the scores of previous work, but this time I looked at yours.  About 2 - 3 times a year your work doesn''t connect with the DPC gang.  <i>but the rest of the time it does</i>.  Please try to get past this one and look forward to all the pleasure and photographic knowledge your images give DPC people.  <br/> <br/>Of course this image is good.  I don''t know why it didn''t connect here.  But I sure do want to see more of your work...<br/> <br/>Take care, Skip.</td>', 'Hello Skip - I hope you reconsider your thought of bowing out of competition here at DPC.  Your work is an inspiration to many photographers on the site.  It''s obvious from the feedback you get every time you post! Now, I almost never bother looking at the scores of previous work, but this time I looked at yours.  About 2 - 3 times a year your work doesn''t connect with the DPC gang.  but the rest of the time it does.  Please try to get past this one and look forward to all the pleasure and photographic knowledge your images give DPC people.   Of course this image is good.  I don''t know why it didn''t connect here.  But I sure do want to see more of your work... Take care, Skip.', '2006-10-27 11:45:52.000000', NULL, 0),
