(2976597, 411214, 30982, '<td valign="top">Hey Jeff, you ALMOST qualified for my "No comments received during a challenge ribbon".  <br/> <br/>I didn''t vote on this challenge and in fact, sadly, really never took the time to even look through it.  What I really like - the deep rich color and spectrum of the green leaves and the way the light slides down the center of them.  What I''m not so sure about is the composition - something seems just slightly out of balance to me, though I''m not sure what I''d do to change it.  The red of the flower may be just a touch overexposed - don''t know if you can change that by adjusting the reds alone in curves or not.</td>', 'Hey Jeff, you ALMOST qualified for my "No comments received during a challenge ribbon".   I didn''t vote on this challenge and in fact, sadly, really never took the time to even look through it.  What I really like - the deep rich color and spectrum of the green leaves and the way the light slides down the center of them.  What I''m not so sure about is the composition - something seems just slightly out of balance to me, though I''m not sure what I''d do to change it.  The red of the flower may be just a touch overexposed - don''t know if you can change that by adjusting the reds alone in curves or not.', '2006-10-30 19:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2976619, 411728, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gotta say I don''t think I''ve ever seen the bulbs like you''re describing.  I think what hurts this is the noise in the bird, though given what it is you''re shooting, I''m not quite sure how to avoid that.</td>', 'Gotta say I don''t think I''ve ever seen the bulbs like you''re describing.  I think what hurts this is the noise in the bird, though given what it is you''re shooting, I''m not quite sure how to avoid that.', '2006-10-30 19:35:48.000000', NULL, 0),
