(2986348, 412533, 51553, '<td valign="top">A definite split - either they get it or they don''t.  I get frustrated sometimes with the subjectivity of it all.  In my perspective, photography is, above all, art.  If others get it, good.  If they don''t, they should at least respect the artists intention.<br/> <br/>Technically, this is a wonderful image.  It has mystery and intrigue as well as beauty and visual appeal.  I didn''t vote in this challenge but if I had, I would have given it a 7 or so.</td>', 'A definite split - either they get it or they don''t.  I get frustrated sometimes with the subjectivity of it all.  In my perspective, photography is, above all, art.  If others get it, good.  If they don''t, they should at least respect the artists intention. Technically, this is a wonderful image.  It has mystery and intrigue as well as beauty and visual appeal.  I didn''t vote in this challenge but if I had, I would have given it a 7 or so.', '2006-11-01 19:47:38.000000', NULL, 0),
