(2993144, 411295, 12611, '<td valign="top">Tremendous work to make mushrooms look like flowers. great lighting and values. I love how your eye is forced right to where the brightest light is and darkest tree bark.</td>', 'Tremendous work to make mushrooms look like flowers. great lighting and values. I love how your eye is forced right to where the brightest light is and darkest tree bark.', '2006-11-03 09:16:56.000000', NULL, 0),
