(3060317, 413076, 41047, '<td valign="top">very powerful portrait, great lighting.</td>', 'very powerful portrait, great lighting.', '2006-11-24 19:35:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3061614, 410710, 27763, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Don''t let the mediocre score get you down.  After reading your photographer''s comments I understand how this shot has to do with lighting ("I see this picture everyday at a certain time the light hits the building...").  Without these comments, though, a viewer (or voter!) may have a hard time understanding that lighting was such a key component to this image.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Don''t let the mediocre score get you down.  After reading your photographer''s comments I understand how this shot has to do with lighting ("I see this picture everyday at a certain time the light hits the building...").  Without these comments, though, a viewer (or voter!) may have a hard time understanding that lighting was such a key component to this image.', '2006-11-25 16:18:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(3064660, 412265, 31637, '<td valign="top">yea, you should not stop. Personally, I would reconsider your disbelief of it''s low score. Challenge topic...Lighting. You chose the natural variety. Your contrast is low because your lighting is too powerful. Low light conditions with only one source of light do well here whether its from the back, front, top and bottom, but only one source of light. You stuck to that rule but In this case , you have a big bright sun. So please do not hold a grudge against voters. In a challenge like lighting, excellent compositions fold if the element is not the main character of the story.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-27 02:08:57.</i></td>', 'yea, you should not stop. Personally, I would reconsider your disbelief of it''s low score. Challenge topic...Lighting. You chose the natural variety. Your contrast is low because your lighting is too powerful. Low light conditions with only one source of light do well here whether its from the back, front, top and bottom, but only one source of light. You stuck to that rule but In this case , you have a big bright sun. So please do not hold a grudge against voters. In a challenge like lighting, excellent compositions fold if the element is not the main character of the story.', '2006-11-27 02:07:52.000000', '2006-11-27 02:08:57.000000', 0),
